of health care is often underfunded. It's been chronically underfunded. And that means that there are often lower wages. But there are also, the working conditions are much harder. When I was Commissioner of Behavioral Health in Philadelphia, I remember we were funding some of the community mental health providers. And we were just giving them small grants to do things like to be able to paint the waiting room. I was doing this in the morning.
医疗保健往往资金不足。它一直长期资金不足。这意味着通常有较低的工资。但也有，工作条件要困难得多。当我是费城行为健康专员时，我记得我们正在资助一些社区心理健康提供者。我们只是给他们小额赠款来做一些事情，比如能够粉刷候诊室。我早上在做这个。

