00:16:48.000 --> 00:17:17.000
Well, I think that things are certainly going to be different. And in many ways, the amount of stress, the amount of activity going on, the fast moving on society is the new normal. But we can adapt. You know, we've learned to adapt as a society for many of these things. And so I think the things we should do is not say that these things that are an assault on our mental health or our physical health, need to go on challenge. So what can we do? We can make sure that as an employer,
嗯，我认为事情肯定会发生变化。在许多方面，压力的数量，正在进行的活动的数量，社会的高速发展就是新常态。但我们可以适应。你知道，作为一个社会，我们已经学会了适应其中的许多事情。所以我认为我们应该做的事情不是说这些对我们的心理健康或身体健康的攻击，需要受到挑战。那么我们能做什么呢？我们可以确保作为雇主，

