00:17:17.000 --> 00:18:11.000
we're providing people with the tools that they need, the crew time, as I mentioned earlier, giving them some time to rest, helping them think about their day. If you as an individual with your family plan to have stress-free days, build, construct your day in a way that reduces your stress, how you get to work, when you get to work, how you engage your family, getting your family some me time, both individually and as a group, are things that you can do to try to de-stress both the environment and the type of way we engage people. And then, you know, what I've noticed is that we have more and more people who, frankly, are having conflict. And when you start looking at how that conflict occurred, far too often is because there's,
我们为人们提供他们需要的工具，正如我前面提到的船员时间，给他们一些时间休息，帮助他们思考他们的一天。如果你作为一个个人和你的家庭计划有无压力的日子，构建，以一种减少你的压力的方式构建你的一天，你如何去上班，你什么时候去上班，你如何让你的家人参与进来，让你的家人有一些属于自己的时间，无论是单独的还是作为一个团队，都是你可以做的事情，试图消除环境和我们让人们参与的方式的压力。然后，你知道，我注意到的是，我们越来越多的人坦率地说有冲突。当你开始研究这种冲突是如何发生的时，往往是因为有，

